          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Connecting **MYOB Acumatica** (formerly MYOB Advanced), **SAP**, **CRM** (such as Dynamics 365 or Salesforce), and **Microsoft 365** involves bridging mid-market and enterprise architectures. Because this typically requires a robust middleware/iPaaS layer (such as Azure Integration Services, Boomi, or MuleSoft), the ideal partner must possess both ERP domain knowledge and strong cloud-integration capabilities.\n\nSeveral top system integration specialists with a strong presence in Canberra are well-suited for this scope:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Mid-Market ERP & MYOB Acumatica Specialists\n*Best if MYOB Acumatica serves as your core operational hub or is being integrated into a parent SAP/CRM environment.*\n\n* **Kilimanjaro Consulting (Enprise Group)**\n  * **Canberra Presence:** Dedicated local consultants and an established ACT portfolio (e.g., Museum of Australian Democracy).\n  * **Core Strength:** They are the largest and premier MYOB Acumatica implementer in ANZ.\n  * **Integration Capability:** Highly experienced in custom API development (.NET, REST APIs, SQL Server) and middleware pipelines connecting MYOB Acumatica to external CRM tools, web portals, and parent ERPs.\n* **FUJIFILM MicroChannel**\n  * **Canberra Presence:** Active local delivery practice.\n  * **Core Strength:** Rare dual-specialization. They are one of the few partners in ANZ that hold top-tier accreditations across **SAP Business One**, **Microsoft Dynamics 365 (CRM & ERP)**, and other mid-market ERP suites. This makes them uniquely qualified if your SAP footprint is at the mid-market level.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Multi-ERP & Cross-Platform Specialists (Canberra Local)\n*Best for vendor-neutral ERP orchestration, custom web services, and workflow bridging.*\n\n* **ERP IT Canberra**\n  * **Canberra Presence:** Locally founded and based in Canberra.\n  * **Core Strength:** Specializes specifically in multi-vendor financial system orchestration. Their team directly handles integration across disparate platforms including **SAP, Microsoft Dynamics, MYOB, and custom web services/APIs** for commercial and public sector entities in the ACT.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Microsoft 365, CRM & Azure Integration Specialists\n*Best if Microsoft 365 / Power Platform / Azure Logic Apps will serve as the integration glue and CRM layer.*\n\n* **Walkerscott**\n  * **Canberra Presence:** Dedicated Canberra team supporting ACT government, semi-government, and commercial clients.\n  * **Core Strength:** Microsoft Solutions Partner focused on Dynamics 365 CRM, Power Platform, and Microsoft 365. They excel at integrating Microsoft suites with third-party ERPs like SAP and MYOB using Azure Integration Services (APIs, Logic Apps, Service Bus).\n* **OPC IT (Fyshwick, Canberra)**\n  * **Canberra Presence:** Long-standing Canberra-based managed services and systems integrator.\n  * **Core Strength:** Deep expertise in Microsoft 365, Power Automate, Power BI, and Dynamics 365. They specialize in building secure API links between Microsoft cloud estates and external line-of-business software.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Large Enterprise & Government Tier-1 Integrators\n*Best if you have a full enterprise SAP instance (e.g., SAP S/4HANA or ECC6) requiring deep security accreditation and complex middleware.*\n\n* **Datacom (Canberra)**\n  * One of the largest systems integrators in the ACT. They run major practices for both **SAP** and **Microsoft (M365, Azure, Dynamics)**, making them well-suited for enterprise-scale middleware design connecting ERPs to CRM and office suites.\n* **DXC Technology / Avanade**\n  * Both have large Canberra practices focused on complex enterprise landscapes, specialized in tying enterprise SAP environments into Microsoft 365 and Dataverse using enterprise integration platforms (Boomi, SAP BTP, MuleSoft).\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Selection Framework\n\n1. **If MYOB Acumatica is the focal point:** Contact **Kilimanjaro Consulting**. Most generic integrators lack the low-level API nuance needed for complex Acumatica entity-level syncs.\n2. **If SAP is the core master data source:** Contact **FUJIFILM MicroChannel** (for SAP B1/mid-market) or **Datacom / ERP IT Canberra** (for complex hybrid SAP environments).\n3. **If Microsoft 365 / Dynamics CRM is the primary hub:** Engage **Walkerscott** or **OPC IT** to build the integration workflows using Azure Logic Apps and Power Automate.",
              "thoughtSignature": ""
            }
          ],
